activity Cargo Receive
activity Cargo Inspect
activity Cargo Document
activity Cargo Scan
activity Cargo Clear
activity Cargo Hold
activity Findings Report
activity Authorities Notify
activity Cargo Release
activity Documentation Archive
activity Cargo Dispatch
activity Entry Log
bind Cargo Receive: ID Cargo
bind Cargo Inspect: ID Cargo, ID Inspector, Result Inspection
bind Cargo Document: ID Cargo, Status Documentation
bind Cargo Scan: ID Cargo, Weight Cargo
bind Cargo Clear: ID Cargo
bind Cargo Hold: ID Cargo
bind Findings Report: ID Cargo, Item Found Prohibited
bind Authorities Notify: ID Cargo, Item Found Prohibited, Status Notification
bind Cargo Release: ID Cargo
bind Documentation Archive: ID Cargo, Status Documentation
bind Cargo Dispatch: ID Cargo
bind Entry Log: ID Cargo
ID Cargo: integer between 1 and 999999
Weight Cargo: float between 0.1 and 10000
ID Inspector: integer between 1 and 9999
Result Inspection: Clear, Hold
Item Found Prohibited: Yes, No
Status Notification: Notified, Not Notified
Status Documentation: Completed, Incomplete
Init[Entry Log] | |
Chain Precedence[Cargo Inspect, Entry Log] | | |
Precedence[Cargo Document, Cargo Inspect] | | |
Absence[Cargo Document] | |
Precedence[Cargo Clear, Cargo Scan] | | |
Chain Succession[Cargo Hold, Findings Report] | | |
Chain Response[Findings Report, Authorities Notify] | | |0,1,h
Response[Cargo Clear, Cargo Release] | | |
Existence[Cargo Release] | |
Chain Response[Cargo Release, Documentation Archive] | | |0,2,h
Response[Cargo Release, Cargo Dispatch] | | |
End[Cargo Dispatch] | |
Existence2[Cargo Clear] | |
Co-Existence[Cargo Scan, Cargo Inspect] | | |
Precedence[Cargo Release, Authorities Notify] | | |